{
  "slug": "cadbuildr-ai-plugin",
  "name": "Cadbuildr Ai Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI plugin for working with CADBuildr, a CAD-as-code platform. Skills for project setup, API reference, broker/viewer iteration, and render/export workflows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `broker-viewer-setup` (Set up local broker and connect foundation show() to hub viewer), `foundation-cheatsheet` (Cheatsheet for the foundation python lib and writing python as CAD code), `foundation-setup` (Helps getting you started with a CADBuildr project that uses the foundation lib), `render-export` (How to use foundation and the kernel-api to render and export meshes)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `cadbuildr`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cadbuildr-ai-plugin@claude-community` from `cadbuildr/cadbuildr-ai-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
